ut, and the \\(3u\\) terms also cancel each other out:\n\n\\[\nu^2 - u^2 + 3u - 3u - 4 + 18 = 0 + 0 + 14 = 14\n\\]\n\nThus, the simplified expression is:\n\n\\[\n\\boxed{14}\n\\]"},"grade":{"answer":"\\boxed{14}","correct":true,"format":"boxed","parseable":true},"id":"algebra:520"}
